// •  Core Gameplay & Physics: I developed the PlayerMovement system, implementing a physics-based controller that handles movement, jumping, 
and collision detection. I integrated a life and scoring system that reacts dynamically to hazards like lava and standard obstacles.
•  Visual Polish & Animation: I programmed the RotateCoin script to enhance the visual feedback of collectible items. 
By using frame-rate independent rotation (Time.deltaTime), I improved the visibility and "game feel" of the rewards within the level.
•  System Logic & UI Flow: I implemented the MainMenuManager to control the game's start and end states. 
This included managing the transition between the main menu and the "Game Over" screen, as well as freezing the game engine when the player loses.
•  Level Triggers: I established the ControlEntradaSalida script to manage the logical flow of the level,
 triggering "START" and "VICTORY" notifications through Unity's trigger-event system.
•  Technical Serialization: I was responsible for the management of .
meta files and Global Identifiers (GUIDs),
 ensuring that all script references remained consistent and functional within the Unity project architecture during the development phase.
